    <ns4:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Aviation gasoline is gasoline used as motor spirit and prepared especially for aviation piston engines, with an octane number suited to the engine, a freezing point of -60 °C and a distillation range usually within the limits of 30 °C and 180 °C.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
