pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/959</ns4:IAO_0000233>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>Ammonia is a portion of matter with the chemical formula NH3. It has a gaseous normal state of matter and can act as an air pollutant. As it can be oxidised it can be used as a fuel.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
