    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="N03abb47003c2472f925644f23173f2aa"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">steam turbine</rdfs:label>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>A steam turbine is a turbine that converts heat from pressurised steam into rotational energy.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
    <ns4:IAO_0000233>change produces energy and uses energy axioms to 'has energy output' and ' has energy input':
