    <ns4:BFO_0000050 rdf:resource="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010042"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'other transportation' is a transport sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Combustion emissions from all remaining transport activities including pipeline transportation, ground activities in airports and harbours, and off-road activities not otherwise reported under 1 A 4 c Agriculture or 1 A 2. Manufacturing Industries and Construction. Military transport should be reported under 1 A 5.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000422"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
