    <ns9:example xml:lang="en">(hasMember worksCouncil1 employee1)</ns9:example>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has member</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">(hasMember ?ENTITY1 ?ENTITY2) means that some agent ?ENTITY1 (usually an organisation) has a person ?ENTITY2 that participates in its activities. This need not represent an employment role nor imply financial incentives between the organisation and person.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
