    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fuel combustion - other</rdfs:label>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'fuel combustion' is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
