    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>A steam reforming process is a chemical reaction that converts hydrocarbons and steam to syngas. As it converts chemical energy and thermal energy to a different type of chemical energy (and waste heat), it is also an energy transformation process.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
