    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/airm-o/ontology#CodeAirspaceReservationPhaseType"/>
    <rdfs:comment>When the consolidation period is entered (based on a fixed point in time OR on a time period before the requested activation time), the Allocated or Approved (not published in the AUP/UUP)reservations become “Reference Allocated” and further updates to them are unlikely to happen.</rdfs:comment>
