    <ns4:BFO_0000051 rdf:resource="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010052"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>The KSG sector buildings is a building sector defined by the KSG sector division. It is an aggregate of the following two sectors:
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): commercial and institutional (CRF 1.A.4.a)
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): residential (CRF 1.A.4.b)
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fuel combustion - other</ns4:IAO_0000115>
    <ns1:OEO_00000504 rdf:resource="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010056"/>
