    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/um/cbcm/eu-cm-ontology#hasCompanyStakeholder"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">(employedBy ?ENTITY1 ?ENTITY2) means that some agent (person or organisation) ?ENTITY1 is promised and delivered an incentive (usually financial) to perform some work for ?ENTITY2 where ?ENTITY2 is an organisation. This exchange is usually governed by law and formal regulations in the particular country or social context in which the work is being performed.</rdfs:comment>
