    <ns4:IAO_0000112>The currency used in France in 2020 was Euro.</ns4:IAO_0000112>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_0000000"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>A unit which is a measure of the medium of an exchange value, defined by reference to the geographical location of the monetary authorities responsible for it.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
