    <rdfs:comment>Regarding hasTransitVehicleId data property for TransitVehicle. The rationale for introducing a new property is that the ID assigned by the transit organization may differ from the manufacturer's ID which is a property we anticipate will apply to vehicles in general. In addition, we've opted to define this as a data property, however should additional semantics be required we anticipate the creation of a general hasId property, and specialized ID classes, (e.g. in this case, TransitVehicle hasId only TransitVehicleId).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
