  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://ontology.eil.utoronto.ca/icity/Parking/EVCharger">
    <rdfs:comment>A charger for electric vehicles is an amenity which may be provided by some parking spaces.
An EV charger has some model and is capable of charging certain classes of vehicles. There are different classes of EV chargers (standard, medium, or quick), defined based on specified attributes according to the EPD (Environmental Protection Department).
An EV charger may be available or in use by some vehicle at a given time. Future availability of an EV charger may be estimated based on the scheduled duration of a vehicle’s occupancy, and the time left to charge the vehicle.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://ontology.eil.utoronto.ca/icity/Parking/ParkingOntologyThing"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
