    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">It provides an indication of the number of red code patients present in the First Aid facility when detecting. The property is called blue code, resuming the classification used in some English-speaking countries.</rdfs:comment>
