    <ns4:IAO_0000115>The EU emission sector ETS aviation is a transport sector defined by an EU emission sector division that covers greenhouse gas emissions regulated by the European Union Emissions Trading System and that are emitted by stationary installations.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
