    <ns1:OEO_00010037>CRF 1.C.2</ns1:OEO_00010037>
    <ns4:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</ns4:IAO_0000119>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CRF sector (IPCC 2006): injection and storage</rdfs:label>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'pipelines' is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
