    <ns4:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'fugitive emissions from fuels' is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Includes all intentional and unintentional emissions from the extraction, processing, storage and transport of solid fuel to the point of final use.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
