  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140076">
    <ns4:IAO_0000233>issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/575
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/633

Move to oeo-shared:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1522
