rework module structure 
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1592
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1652</ns4:IAO_0000233>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>Secondary energy carrier disposition is an energy carrier disposition of material entities that are manufactured from primary energy carriers or from a different form of secondary energy carriers.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
    <ns4:IAO_0000112>blast furnace gas, coke oven gas, cokes, motor gasoline or electricity have the disposition to be a secondary energy carrier</ns4:IAO_0000112>
