    <dcterms:subject xml:lang="en">Ontology, Semantic SEO, RDFa, Linked Data, RDF, Semantic Web, Smart Recommender Systems, Smart City, Transportation Network, Smart Mobility, Citizens Services, Semantic Model, knowledge model</dcterms:subject>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">km4city: the DISIT Knowledge Model for City and Mobility</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
