    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/airm-o/ontology#CodeCloudType"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Detached cloud, generally dense and with sharp outlines, developing vertically in the form of rising mounds, domes or towers, of which the bulging upper part is often like a cauliflower. The sunlit parts are mostly brilliant white and the base is relatively dark and nearly horizontal. Sometimes Cumulus clouds are ragged.</rdfs:comment>
