  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/airm-o/ontology#CodeAircraftType-UNMANNED_AERIAL_VEHICLE">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/airm-o/ontology#CodeAircraftType"/>
    <rdfs:comment>An unmanned aerial vehicle is a pilotless aircraft, in the sense of Article 8 of the Convention on International Civil Aviation, which is flown without a pilot-in-command on-board and is either remotely and fully controlled from another place (ground, another aircraft, space) or programmed and fully autonomous.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>UNMANNED_AERIAL_VEHICLE</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
