    <ns4:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'oil and natural gas' is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Comprises fugitive emissions from all oil and natural gas activities.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
