  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020168">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">fixed cost</rdfs:label>
    <ns4:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">fixed operation and maintenance cost</ns4:IAO_0000118>
    <ns4:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="de">Fixkosten</ns4:IAO_0000118>
    <ns4:IAO_0000233>issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1022

Reformulate definition to singular:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1257
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1260</ns4:IAO_0000233>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>A fixed cost is a cost for operation and maintenance that does not vary with the amount of goods or services produced.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000119>oemof-Model: https://oemof-solph.readthedocs.io/en/latest/_modules/oemof/solph/options.html?highlight=fix%20costs

Fixe Kosten: Kosten, die von der jeweils betrachteten Einflussgröße bzw. Entscheidung unabhängig sind, d.h. Kosten, die sich nicht mit der jeweils betrachteten Einflussgröße ändern. (https://wirtschaftslexikon.gabler.de/definition/fixe-kosten-33359)</ns4:IAO_0000119>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00040009"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000112>rent, regular technical maintenance cost, staff cost, certification cost</ns4:IAO_0000112>
  </rdf:Description>
