    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>A without measures scenario (WOM) is a policy scenario that excludes all policy instruments and transformative measures which are planned, adopted or implemented.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
