    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">without measures scenario</rdfs:label>
    <ns4:IAO_0000233>issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1329
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1614

rework module structure 
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1592
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1652</ns4:IAO_0000233>
