    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:nodeID="N29420f965fb644e18d0c0b737628f185"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">fossil energy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000007"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000233>issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/833
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/955

Update definition and axiom:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1172
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1185</ns4:IAO_0000233>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>Fossil energy is chemical energy that is stored in fossil combustion fuels and thus has a conventional origin.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
