    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">methane</rdfs:label>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>Methane is a hydrocarbon with the chemical formula CH4. It has a gaseous normal state of matter. It occurs naturally in the atmosphere as a trace gas and can work as a greenhouse gas. As it can be oxidised it can be used as a fuel.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
