    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">(authoredBy ?ENTITY1 ?ENTITY2) means that ?ENTITY1 is an instance of a publication that is created primarily by the entity referred to by ?ENTITY2.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns9:example>(authoredBy independentExpertReport1 independentExpert1)</ns9:example>
