    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Is the company having a transnational information and consultation agreement in place? Does the company have an internal body which discusses employee rights and welfare?

Different from works council. TNIC is global.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/um/cbcm/eu-cm-ontology#Company"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has TNIC</rdfs:label>
