  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010239">
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>A gasoline fuel role is a fuel role that expresses that a portion of matter can be used in a gasoline engine.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
