    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/um/cbcm/eu-cm-ontology#Company"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">(hasTransactionInput ?ENTITY1 ?ENTITY2) means that some company transaction ?ENTITY1 has a prerequisite entity ?ENTITY2 that needs to be considered, assessed, or modified during the transaction referred to by ?ENTITY1.</rdfs:comment>
