pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1717</ns4:IAO_0000233>
    <ns4:IAO_0000115>An energy balance data set is an empirical data set that describes a specified set of energy transformations and a specified set of energy carriers in a spatial region for a specific time step (usually a year).</ns4:IAO_0000115>
