  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140096">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000206"/>
    <ns4:IAO_0000233>issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/527
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/723

move axiom to shared-axioms
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1703
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1706</ns4:IAO_0000233>
