  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.disit.org/km4city/schema#timestamp">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">One-second time interval, usually used as a time instant, to provide time allocation to a generic event. EVEN IF INSTANT IS INTRODUCED, THIS ATTRIBUTE MUST BE PRESERVED.</rdfs:comment>
