  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://ontology.eil.utoronto.ca/icity/TransportationSystem/PlanningDistrict">
    <rdfs:comment>We observe that the properties inMunicipality and inPlanningDistrict will likely apply to other areas of the domain (e.g. land use, building ontologies). It is likely that they will be better defined at a lower (more foundational) level within the ontology, however it is currently not clear where and how this should be done. For now, we define these properties within the Transportation Network System ontology and leave the final organization for a future iteration when the use and related concepts is more clear.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://ontology.eil.utoronto.ca/icity/TransportationSystem/TransportationOntologyThing"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
